        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-920-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH921-DAT-BIN-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH922-PROOF-MERKLE-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH923-TPA-BIN-LAT-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
